{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNir922Bup4r4cwkjVhe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The change does what T2 asks and nothing it forbids.\n\n- **Overdraw:** `Ledger.remove` now raises `ValueError` when `qty` is more than the quantity in stock. An unknown SKU counts as 0 in stock, so any positive removal from it raises.\n- **Refused removal:** the check runs before `_stock` is touched or `_history` is appended. A refused removal changes neither the stock nor the history, and it doesn't create an entry for an unknown SKU.\n- **Exact removal:** removing exactly the quantity in stock passes the check, because `qty > stock` is false. It leaves 0.\n- **Scope:** the only change is the two-line guard in `stocklib/ledger.py`. `add`, `quantity`, `skus` and `history` are unchanged.\n\nI only read the diff and the file. I didn't run any code or tests.\n\nWIP-REVIEW WIP-NONCE:bf36c119ef1ef6cf cfc0b35e69088c86edfef12837ce2d6fb75987fc approve\nOPEN_FLEET_WORKER_DONE disp_b06e00c477 succeeded"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":589,"cache_read_input_tokens":18612,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":589,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":377,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99dd9355-28aa-4bb7-bc45-9c36003e23eb","uuid":"672dc426-e88f-4c15-9825-08a437cb5aa4","timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:31:11.007Z","request_id":"req_011CgNir8gvkhcfcbSMCgHEr"}
